  "content": "<style>p {text-align:center;}</style>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align-center\">Пожалуйста, используйте загрузку с CurseForge и не размещайте файлы где-то ещё.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод может использоваться в любых пакетах модов. (На CurseForge)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">В настоящее время нет плана для версии Fabric, извините.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Для тех, кто спрашивал про пакеты ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Улучшенные инструменты</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Доступны альтернативные текстуры ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Улучшенный нителит: Альтернатива</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;(Обновлено!)</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Описание</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Добавляет броню, конскую броню, оружие и инструменты из креативита.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>/!\\&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Этот мод не имеет крафта. Вы должны добавить его самостоятельно с помощью datapack или мода такого, как <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a>.</span><strong>/!\\</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Эффекты</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><strong>Creativerite</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Оружие &amp; Щит</strong></em>: Убивает мгновенно.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Инструменты</strong></em>: Разрушает мгновенно.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Конская броня</strong></em>:沒有任何伤害，没有有害效果，回复生命值。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Броня</strong></em>: Лётность,沒有任何伤害，没有有害效果, насыщение, восстановление здоровья.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Настройка для невидимого прыжка.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Мои другие моды</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 +</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Старые</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
